# decentralized-minting enclave manifest - DRAFT (ecosystem-ownership-plan Phase 5, row 5.2). NOT ACTIVE.
# merge_pr reads only a root .enclave (or v3/.enclave); this copy under docs/proposals/phase5-decentralized-minting/ is inert.
# Adoption = the operator moves it to the repo root. Paths are repo-root-relative.
# Once adopted, changes to these paths merging into master need operator approval.
# Format: one path per line; trailing "/" = directory prefix; "#" = comment.
# Why each entry is here: CANONICAL_CONTRACT.md. This file is enclaved itself.
# Decision 2 clarification 2026-10-13: exact Aiken/Helios on-chain source only.
# Test-only sources, npm/JS/TS/builders/config/artifacts/workflows are normal agent review.
# Embedded test-only hunks are outside policy scope; path-only enforcement cannot distinguish them.
# Signing/settings/irreversible/double-mint authority remains in CANONICAL_CONTRACT.md.

